DataMaster - Professional Data Analysis and Manipulation Tool

Executive Summary
DataMaster is a powerful application for MANIPULATING, cleaning, transforming, analyzing, and exporting structured datasets. It provides a user-friendly interface that eliminates the need for programming knowledge while serving as a central data processing hub within the AquaStream360 ecosystem.
________________________________________
Core Capabilities
1. Data Import and Management
•	Multi-format Support: Excel (.xlsx, .xls), CSV, JSON, text files, PostgreSQL databases
•	Sheet Management: Handle multi-sheet Excel files with intelligent selection and merging
•	Data Preservation: Original datasets remain untouched during transformations
•	Database Integration: Connect directly to PostgreSQL for live data retrieval
2. Data Cleaning and Preparation
•	Handle missing values with mean/median imputation, forward filling, or custom replacements
•	Identify and remove duplicates
•	Convert between numeric, text, and date types
•	Standardize formatting (whitespace removal, casing, special character correction)
•	Bulk value replacement for text and numeric data
3. Data Transformation
•	Add, remove, rename, reorder, and split columns
•	Insert, delete, filter, and sort rows
•	Create calculated fields (mathematical operations, text manipulation)
•	Reshape data: pivot, melt, stack, unstack, transpose
4. Advanced Data Analysis
•	Descriptive statistics: mean, median, mode, standard deviation, percentiles
•	Correlation matrices to detect relationships
•	Grouping and aggregation functions (sum, average, count, min, max)
•	Trend analysis and pattern detection
•	Outlier identification (IQR, z-scores)
•	Simple linear regression for prediction
5. Filtering and Selection
•	Conditional filters with operators (>, <, =, !=, contains, starts/ends with)
•	Range-based selection (numerical or date ranges)
•	Multi-criteria filtering with AND/OR logic
•	Advanced filtering using regular expressions
6. Data Visualization
•	Generate bar, line, scatter, histogram, and pie charts
•	Correlation heatmaps and pattern visualizations
•	Automatic data profiling and quality reports
•	Export visualizations in standard formats
7. Quality Assurance
•	Automatic data quality scoring
•	Validation rules and cross-validation for predictive models
•	Comparison of multiple datasets
•	Detailed error reporting
8. Workflow Management
•	Undo/redo all operations
•	Version control with side-by-side comparison
•	Batch processing for multiple datasets or columns
•	Save transformation templates for reuse
9. Export and Integration
•	Export to Excel, CSV, JSON, HTML, or databases
•	Generate analysis reports with statistics and charts
•	Seamless data transfer to other AquaStream360 applications
•	API access via Python interface for advanced users
